            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Emma R.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Perfect Valentine's Day gift! The rose is really beautiful and looks delicate, but it's actually sturdy. My boyfriend had 'E♡T Forever' engraved and it's exactly what I was hoping for. I wear it every day.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_jxk4nh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CUHycauCrF_mid.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Julie D.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>For our 5th anniversary with my husband, I chose the red rose with the rose gold necklace. The engraving of our wedding date is crisp and legible. The packaging was beautiful. A keepsake we'll treasure for life!</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_pyz4pT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/OTTQViMNB_mid.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Thomas B.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>My mom loved it! I gave it to her for Mother's Day with 'Mom ♥' engraved. She put it on her dresser and shows the necklace to all her friends. Very happy with my purchase, thank you Soraya Paris.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
